1
00:00:07,541 --> 00:00:08,916
Come on.

2
00:00:13,708 --> 00:00:14,875
Hang in there.

3
00:00:15,583 --> 00:00:16,458
Come on.

4
00:00:19,833 --> 00:00:22,041
You'll be fine.
Boss Wan will be here soon.

5
00:00:25,291 --> 00:00:27,083
Swamp Eel.

6
00:00:27,583 --> 00:00:28,875
If I die,

7
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:34,041
you have to take care of my wife
and Chia-yun. All right?

8
00:00:34,125 --> 00:00:35,625
Take care, my ass.

9
00:00:35,708 --> 00:00:38,458
You're the one
who's gonna take care of them. All right?

10
00:00:40,375 --> 00:00:41,583
Fuck, who am I?

11
00:00:41,666 --> 00:00:44,041
I'm Swamp Eel.
I shot flies to get where I am.

12
00:00:44,916 --> 00:00:47,458
You're in good hands.
You're gonna be all right.

13
00:00:47,541 --> 00:00:48,375
Relax, relax.

14
00:00:50,375 --> 00:00:53,541
Hang in there. You're gonna be fine.
Hang in there, will you?

15
00:00:54,666 --> 00:00:56,166
-Quick, quick, in there!
-Fuck.

16
00:00:56,250 --> 00:00:58,041
-We can get down…
-They'll be here.

17
00:00:58,125 --> 00:00:59,791
Get out.

18
00:01:01,333 --> 00:01:02,500
Wan's not coming.

19
00:01:03,125 --> 00:01:05,250
They'll be here. Don't you worry.

20
00:01:05,333 --> 00:01:06,500
They'll be here.

21
00:01:07,250 --> 00:01:08,958
You're lying to yourself.

22
00:01:09,750 --> 00:01:10,875
If they were coming,

23
00:01:11,875 --> 00:01:13,416
they'd be here already.

24
00:01:14,791 --> 00:01:16,166
And you know that.

25
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:24,625
Hang in there.

26
00:01:26,166 --> 00:01:27,250
Don't worry.

27
00:01:27,333 --> 00:01:29,791
You're in good hands.
You're gonna be all right.

28
00:01:37,416 --> 00:01:39,541
Hang in there. You're gonna be fine.

29
00:01:39,625 --> 00:01:41,416
Hang in there, will you? Fuck you!

30
00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:43,041
Hang in there.

31
00:02:14,125 --> 00:02:15,875
I get to fire the shot.

32
00:02:22,125 --> 00:02:24,458
The one I didn't get to fire back then.

33
00:02:32,458 --> 00:02:34,500
You still hung up about A-chi?

34
00:02:34,583 --> 00:02:36,250
While I still have breath,

35
00:02:36,750 --> 00:02:38,291
I will never forget.

36
00:02:39,833 --> 00:02:43,166
Lin Wan-li, you were never worthy
of being a leader.

37
00:02:47,625 --> 00:02:52,208
After I leave the mountain,
it'll be my own brother who sees me off.

38
00:02:53,916 --> 00:02:55,875
I would rather die by your hand.

39
00:02:58,750 --> 00:03:00,041
Go on and shoot.

40
00:03:00,541 --> 00:03:03,708
You bastard.
You told us to ambush those traitors.

41
00:03:03,791 --> 00:03:06,458
You said you'd send reinforcements,
but what happened?

42
00:03:07,458 --> 00:03:08,791
A-chi's death.

43
00:03:08,875 --> 00:03:09,958
It's on your head.

44
00:03:11,250 --> 00:03:14,875
They were so prepared,
and they had powerful backers.

45
00:03:14,958 --> 00:03:16,666
If I had sent anyone,

46
00:03:17,166 --> 00:03:19,458
the death count would have been higher.

47
00:03:21,041 --> 00:03:22,875
If I had a second chance,

48
00:03:24,166 --> 00:03:26,625
my decision would remain unchanged.

49
00:03:33,750 --> 00:03:34,833
-Swamp Eel.
-Yeah?

50
00:03:35,958 --> 00:03:37,291
Tell Boss Wan

51
00:03:38,125 --> 00:03:39,541
I'm leaving now.

52
00:03:40,458 --> 00:03:41,958
Tell him to take care.

53
00:04:09,375 --> 00:04:10,458
Did you know?

54
00:04:12,458 --> 00:04:13,958
As A-chi died…

55
00:04:16,500 --> 00:04:18,333
he still called you the leader.

56
00:04:21,125 --> 00:04:22,166
Don't forget.

57
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:24,250
You're still living

58
00:04:24,916 --> 00:04:26,041
thanks to him.

59
00:04:54,666 --> 00:04:57,166
If you can wake up, that's a good sign.

60
00:05:28,833 --> 00:05:31,000
THE FIXERS

61
00:05:32,291 --> 00:05:35,666
ONE SHORT

62
00:05:36,333 --> 00:05:40,041
Nothing to worry about, sweetie.
It's just my ear got a little hurt.

63
00:05:40,125 --> 00:05:41,708
It'll be all right.

64
00:05:42,500 --> 00:05:45,375
A-pin and A-hsiu, those clowns.

65
00:05:45,458 --> 00:05:47,625
They've almost managed to split San He.

66
00:05:47,708 --> 00:05:49,958
I'll see you after I've sorted things.

67
00:05:50,958 --> 00:05:52,750
Uh-huh. Take care.

68
00:05:54,541 --> 00:05:59,125
Hsiu, our people saw with their own eyes
you were the kidnappers.

69
00:05:59,208 --> 00:06:01,083
You got the ransom money.

70
00:06:02,083 --> 00:06:05,041
If anything happens to my brother,
I'll make you pay for it.

71
00:06:05,125 --> 00:06:06,916
There's also the chance
you're the kidnapper.

72
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,791
What did he say?

73
00:06:13,083 --> 00:06:14,208
Enough!

74
00:06:19,250 --> 00:06:21,708
What's going on?
Get out of the way. Move back.

75
00:06:21,791 --> 00:06:22,833
-Boss.
-Boss.

76
00:06:22,916 --> 00:06:23,791
-Boss.
-Boss.

77
00:06:23,875 --> 00:06:24,708
Boss.

78
00:06:26,625 --> 00:06:28,500
Is this a stare-down?

79
00:06:28,583 --> 00:06:29,958
Move back!

80
00:06:32,916 --> 00:06:33,750
A-pin.

81
00:06:34,916 --> 00:06:38,250
Thank goodness
you had people looking for me everywhere.

82
00:06:38,791 --> 00:06:43,333
However, I was abducted by two idiots

83
00:06:43,416 --> 00:06:45,041
who had nothing to do with A-hsiu.

84
00:06:45,125 --> 00:06:46,916
And what did I say before?

85
00:06:47,875 --> 00:06:50,291
Peace above all.

86
00:06:51,625 --> 00:06:54,666
This incident was all a misunderstanding.

87
00:06:54,750 --> 00:06:56,666
It would be respectful

88
00:06:56,750 --> 00:06:59,458
if you were to let this matter rest.

89
00:06:59,958 --> 00:07:03,666
As members of San He,
we have to look after each other

90
00:07:03,750 --> 00:07:06,083
so that others don't take advantage.

91
00:07:06,666 --> 00:07:08,583
Since everyone's here,

92
00:07:08,666 --> 00:07:12,500
I'd like to take this chance
to make an announcement.

93
00:07:20,500 --> 00:07:25,875
This dear young brother of mine
has coveted my position for a long time.

94
00:07:29,291 --> 00:07:31,791
But during my life,
I've let down too many people

95
00:07:31,875 --> 00:07:33,250
who have called me brother.

96
00:07:33,333 --> 00:07:34,166
Hmm.

97
00:07:34,250 --> 00:07:36,541
It's time to step down.

98
00:07:38,125 --> 00:07:42,083
And you're sure
that your brother's the right candidate.

99
00:07:42,666 --> 00:07:43,583
Mm.

100
00:07:44,125 --> 00:07:47,500
As of today, all association affairs

101
00:07:47,583 --> 00:07:50,958
are to be handed over
to my brother, Lin Kuei-pin.

102
00:07:51,041 --> 00:07:53,500
-It's about time.
-I am retiring.

103
00:07:59,541 --> 00:08:02,833
You have to be ruthless in your actions.

104
00:08:02,916 --> 00:08:06,458
When you need to, betray your family.

105
00:08:07,458 --> 00:08:09,208
Like this time, A-pin.

106
00:08:10,416 --> 00:08:13,583
You wanted to take your own brother out.

107
00:08:14,416 --> 00:08:17,833
Which just proves you're more ruthless.

108
00:08:19,583 --> 00:08:20,916
San He.

109
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:23,583
It's all yours.

110
00:08:23,666 --> 00:08:24,541
Okay?

111
00:08:30,416 --> 00:08:32,000
As for Fixer Shadow,

112
00:08:32,083 --> 00:08:34,000
Hsiu's helped us take care of it.

113
00:08:34,500 --> 00:08:36,291
For people like us,

114
00:08:36,375 --> 00:08:39,916
shouldering the blame for others
isn't an issue, is it?

115
00:08:42,750 --> 00:08:45,000
You're an important client of Ching He.

116
00:08:45,583 --> 00:08:48,166
If it's you who spreads the word, then…

117
00:08:48,708 --> 00:08:50,583
then all should be fine.

118
00:08:51,083 --> 00:08:54,291
Who would dare
threaten Ching He's people, huh?

119
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:03,291
Hey, you need some swamp eel.

120
00:09:03,375 --> 00:09:06,041
It's good for the blood and builds muscle.
And good for healing.

121
00:09:07,875 --> 00:09:09,625
Wow!

122
00:09:09,708 --> 00:09:12,083
Light rain on the streets, soft as milk.

123
00:09:12,166 --> 00:09:14,958
It's like a display home, isn't it?

124
00:09:15,041 --> 00:09:15,958
-Fortune.
-Yeah.

125
00:09:16,041 --> 00:09:18,083
Sit. Say hello to our guest.

126
00:09:21,041 --> 00:09:24,250
The dog is also called Fortune.
Is that deliberate?

127
00:09:24,958 --> 00:09:27,291
What do you think?

128
00:09:27,375 --> 00:09:29,083
How are you? The wound getting better?

129
00:09:29,166 --> 00:09:31,166
Ah, I'll survive.

130
00:09:31,250 --> 00:09:33,875
Let me tell you,
you're fortunate to have met me.

131
00:09:33,958 --> 00:09:37,083
If anyone else had treated that wound,
you'd be crippled. Ha.

132
00:09:37,166 --> 00:09:39,750
When I was young, I was shot three times.

133
00:09:39,833 --> 00:09:41,916
Shoulder, abdomen, and left thigh.

134
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:45,375
There were two words to describe it.
Close shave. Ha.

135
00:09:47,791 --> 00:09:49,166
Are you going to ask what happened?

136
00:09:49,875 --> 00:09:50,833
Why should I?

137
00:09:51,833 --> 00:09:53,000
You got better.

138
00:09:54,916 --> 00:09:59,375
Yeah. If you're gonna give me nothing,
I might as well talk to my buddy, Fortune.

139
00:09:59,458 --> 00:10:01,333
Fortune, come here.

140
00:10:01,416 --> 00:10:03,083
Good dog.

141
00:10:03,166 --> 00:10:04,000
Ha.

142
00:10:05,083 --> 00:10:06,375
Ah.

143
00:10:06,458 --> 00:10:08,541
That guy looks familiar.

144
00:10:08,625 --> 00:10:10,666
Is that the person
who's running for mayor?

145
00:10:10,750 --> 00:10:13,625
The one who's always on the news.
How come you two are in a photo together?

146
00:10:13,708 --> 00:10:15,750
-Why so many questions?
-Wait.

147
00:10:16,250 --> 00:10:18,416
-You two are looking quite similar.
-He's my brother.

148
00:10:19,666 --> 00:10:20,500
The older one.

149
00:10:22,375 --> 00:10:23,625
Your older brother.

150
00:10:23,708 --> 00:10:25,375
Holy shit.

151
00:10:25,458 --> 00:10:28,833
Hey, why is someone like you
working as a fixer?

152
00:10:28,916 --> 00:10:29,791
Are you mad?

153
00:10:29,875 --> 00:10:32,375
It makes me happy. Eat, will you?

154
00:10:33,958 --> 00:10:35,666
I respect that. Point taken.

155
00:10:35,750 --> 00:10:37,708
Everybody's got things
they don't wanna talk about.

156
00:10:38,416 --> 00:10:40,500
You look like
you should be the older brother.

157
00:10:42,041 --> 00:10:43,416
-Can I ask you?
-Yeah.

158
00:10:43,500 --> 00:10:45,583
Why'd you spare Lin Wan-li that day?

159
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:59,458
BELOVED FATHER, CHEN LIANG-CHI

160
00:11:05,875 --> 00:11:07,583
BELOVED MOTHER, WANG SHU-HUA

161
00:11:07,666 --> 00:11:09,750
Mom. Dad.

162
00:11:10,958 --> 00:11:12,916
I got into an American school.

163
00:11:14,208 --> 00:11:17,166
So for a while,
I might not be able to come.

164
00:11:23,166 --> 00:11:24,041
Mm.

165
00:11:24,916 --> 00:11:28,875
A-chi, lowly parents
can produce an exceptional child.

166
00:11:29,375 --> 00:11:31,166
Your Chen Chia-yun, she's amazing.

167
00:11:31,250 --> 00:11:33,166
She's off to the US to study.

168
00:11:34,583 --> 00:11:37,250
And, please, be happy she's flying away.

169
00:11:37,833 --> 00:11:40,500
Give her your blessing
so she's safe and sound.

170
00:11:40,583 --> 00:11:43,125
And hopefully, she'll return
with a foreign boyfriend on her arm.

171
00:11:43,208 --> 00:11:44,208
Sh!

172
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:48,833
Okay.

173
00:12:00,458 --> 00:12:02,541
Mom, I'm doing great right now.

174
00:12:04,041 --> 00:12:06,458
My brother is looking after me.
Don't worry.

175
00:12:07,750 --> 00:12:09,291
We're playing tennis again.

176
00:12:09,791 --> 00:12:11,708
Though I can still beat him.

177
00:12:17,208 --> 00:12:18,166
And Dad…

178
00:12:18,916 --> 00:12:21,625
Dad's been tied up with work.

179
00:12:22,125 --> 00:12:25,291
He can't make it here,
but don't take it personally.

180
00:12:30,250 --> 00:12:31,958
I wish you were still here.

181
00:12:44,250 --> 00:12:45,666
DAD

182
00:13:02,208 --> 00:13:04,750
From when my great-grandfather
served as a legislator

183
00:13:04,833 --> 00:13:06,208
to now with my father,

184
00:13:06,291 --> 00:13:09,583
my family have dedicated their lives
to serving society.

185
00:13:09,666 --> 00:13:11,375
And now I take the baton.

186
00:13:11,875 --> 00:13:15,083
I will live up to their efforts,
and continue to serve.

187
00:13:15,583 --> 00:13:18,083
Today, I'd like to thank my mother.

188
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:21,708
She has always stood
by our family's choices.

189
00:13:22,208 --> 00:13:25,583
Without her contribution,
the Hsueh family wouldn't be here.

190
00:13:51,833 --> 00:13:53,333
So are we on a…

191
00:13:54,625 --> 00:13:57,041
a date, or, um…

192
00:13:58,083 --> 00:13:59,625
I think you owe me a favor.

193
00:14:02,583 --> 00:14:04,541
-And why is that?
-You owe your life to me.

194
00:14:05,541 --> 00:14:10,375
I wanted Lin Wan-li to tell me
about someone I need to find.

195
00:14:11,625 --> 00:14:13,291
Is this to do with the necklace?

196
00:14:13,375 --> 00:14:14,208
Yes.

197
00:14:15,041 --> 00:14:16,583
Why are you looking for them?

198
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:19,583
His name is Gerald Chen.

199
00:14:20,875 --> 00:14:22,875
He's very important to me.

200
00:14:23,541 --> 00:14:27,041
He was a fixer for Yeh Yueh Tong
a long time ago.

201
00:14:28,500 --> 00:14:31,333
Over a year ago, he suddenly vanished.

202
00:14:32,125 --> 00:14:34,708
Lin Wan-li said
that Gerald had come to see him.

203
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:38,125
Gerald Chen did come for a visit.

204
00:14:38,958 --> 00:14:42,875
It was about someone from Yuan Tao
called Zoe.

205
00:14:42,958 --> 00:14:44,333
But I refused.

206
00:14:44,833 --> 00:14:47,958
I wanted nothing to do with Yeh Yueh Tong.

207
00:14:48,500 --> 00:14:51,750
One of the founders of the Yuan Tao, Zoe,

208
00:14:52,583 --> 00:14:55,791
she died over a year ago
in an accident in Vietnam.

209
00:14:55,875 --> 00:14:58,458
I lost contact with Gerald
around then too.

210
00:14:58,541 --> 00:15:02,291
If I can get into Yuan Tao,
maybe I can find him.

211
00:15:04,500 --> 00:15:07,916
I made contact with Zoe's older sister,
and I'm gonna meet her here.

212
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:10,500
Oh. Pretending you're her friend.

213
00:15:10,583 --> 00:15:12,291
I went to college with her.

214
00:15:13,125 --> 00:15:15,625
I wasn't aware of the awful news.

215
00:15:15,708 --> 00:15:18,958
We studied abroad together.
I was hoping to catch up.

216
00:15:19,041 --> 00:15:21,416
What about her partner? Is he doing okay?

217
00:15:21,500 --> 00:15:24,250
Her husband's no longer with us.

218
00:15:24,333 --> 00:15:26,791
My sister's family were always cheerful.

219
00:15:27,916 --> 00:15:30,333
I would never have thought that…

220
00:15:30,416 --> 00:15:33,166
Zoe's husband was a legislative aide.

221
00:15:33,666 --> 00:15:37,333
Just before her accident,
he committed suicide.

222
00:15:37,416 --> 00:15:38,791
Does her sister know Gerald Chen?

223
00:15:38,875 --> 00:15:40,083
Mm-mm.

224
00:15:40,666 --> 00:15:43,625
But she did mention
Yuan Tao's other founder.

225
00:15:43,708 --> 00:15:44,666
William.

226
00:15:44,750 --> 00:15:46,916
We also believe
the value of blockchain technology…

227
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:49,750
William and my sister had a falling out.

228
00:15:50,375 --> 00:15:55,500
I don't wanna cast suspicion on anyone,
but I heard them arguing over Yuan Tao.

229
00:15:55,583 --> 00:15:58,458
Zoe said that William had ruined
the years of effort

230
00:15:58,541 --> 00:16:00,333
she had put into building it.

231
00:16:00,416 --> 00:16:03,125
So you think Zoe's death is related?

232
00:16:03,208 --> 00:16:04,958
He must have known about Zoe.

233
00:16:05,041 --> 00:16:09,125
So he could also have some news
about Gerald.

234
00:16:10,416 --> 00:16:11,958
I need you to help me.

235
00:16:14,875 --> 00:16:17,500
Why don't you ask Yeh Yueh Tong
to help you?

236
00:16:19,458 --> 00:16:21,458
Your family is so well known.

237
00:16:22,208 --> 00:16:24,750
For you to get close
to one of the group's founders

238
00:16:24,833 --> 00:16:26,708
should be a lot easier.

239
00:16:28,750 --> 00:16:30,041
How did you know?

240
00:16:30,625 --> 00:16:33,000
You're not very good at hiding it.

241
00:16:37,916 --> 00:16:39,458
Apart from Fixer Fortune,

242
00:16:39,541 --> 00:16:43,583
I saw you have another friend
from Yeh Yueh Tong.

243
00:16:44,083 --> 00:16:45,375
We're not close,

244
00:16:45,958 --> 00:16:48,750
but she did help out
on the Lin Wan-li case.

245
00:16:49,833 --> 00:16:51,708
I'm not going to pursue it.

246
00:16:51,791 --> 00:16:54,958
If I intended to,
I wouldn't have waited until now.

247
00:16:55,458 --> 00:16:57,083
Did you get your necklace back?

248
00:16:58,375 --> 00:16:59,291
I did.

249
00:17:01,375 --> 00:17:05,791
I'm hearing that you've become close
to a fixer from Ching He.

250
00:17:06,708 --> 00:17:08,666
I wanted my necklace returned.

251
00:17:11,875 --> 00:17:14,708
I didn't reveal anything
about Ching He to her.

252
00:17:17,375 --> 00:17:21,041
Having one more friend in Yeh Yueh Tong
isn't such a bad thing.

253
00:17:21,541 --> 00:17:24,500
Of all the fixers, I trust you the most.

254
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:28,791
There are certain things
you should know about.

255
00:17:29,833 --> 00:17:34,833
Some years ago, Fixer Lunar,
now Madam Fan of Yeh Yueh Tong,

256
00:17:35,500 --> 00:17:39,791
she and her father
disobeyed Ching He's rules.

257
00:17:39,875 --> 00:17:40,708
As a result,

258
00:17:40,791 --> 00:17:44,291
all the branches elected me
as Fixer Celestial.

259
00:17:45,041 --> 00:17:49,041
Since then,
Madam Fan has harbored a grudge.

260
00:17:49,625 --> 00:17:50,750
Take care.

261
00:17:50,833 --> 00:17:53,958
Soon, Ching He will be less peaceful.

262
00:17:54,458 --> 00:17:59,291
Hence, I'm concerned
there will be trouble ahead.

263
00:18:00,375 --> 00:18:03,791
You need to take more care.
Don't get dragged into it.

264
00:18:04,500 --> 00:18:08,166
If Yeh Yueh Tong does anything
to harm Ching He, I will tell you.

265
00:18:10,791 --> 00:18:14,750
This time San He's commission
didn't go to Yeh Yueh Tong.

266
00:18:14,833 --> 00:18:17,083
How did Madam Fan find out?

267
00:18:17,833 --> 00:18:19,083
It's not about them.

268
00:18:19,583 --> 00:18:22,833
Mina wanted Lin Wan-li
to tell her about someone.

269
00:18:23,666 --> 00:18:24,500
Who is it?

270
00:18:24,583 --> 00:18:27,125
Gerald Chen from Yeh Yueh Tong.

271
00:18:29,291 --> 00:18:32,958
Every time I see you,
I am reminded of Gerald.

272
00:18:33,583 --> 00:18:35,833
If he hadn't gone missing back then,

273
00:18:36,333 --> 00:18:40,958
you two would be
Yeh Yueh Tong's most outstanding fixers.

274
00:18:41,833 --> 00:18:43,875
I wanna find him even more than you do.

275
00:18:46,083 --> 00:18:50,375
Are you sure it's Mina Shen
who wants to find Gerald Chen

276
00:18:50,458 --> 00:18:52,208
and not Yeh Yueh Tong?

277
00:18:52,875 --> 00:18:53,791
I'm sure.

278
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:57,083
Madam Fan.

279
00:18:57,583 --> 00:19:00,416
Yuan Tao.
Have they ever given us a commission?

280
00:19:01,375 --> 00:19:04,291
Yuan Tao never commissioned Yeh Yueh Tong.

281
00:19:06,291 --> 00:19:08,708
-Is there anything else?
-No.

282
00:19:17,958 --> 00:19:21,125
CHRONIC GI DISCOMFORT?
BEWARE OF PARKINSON'S!

283
00:19:21,750 --> 00:19:24,791
WESTERN MEDICINE:
PARKINSON'S MAY START IN THE GUT

284
00:19:34,208 --> 00:19:36,375
GOLDIE

285
00:19:38,083 --> 00:19:40,208
How long have you had a second cell?

286
00:19:40,791 --> 00:19:43,041
-And who's this young Gold?
-They're a client.

287
00:19:43,125 --> 00:19:45,625
-Male or female?
-Male!

288
00:19:45,708 --> 00:19:48,541
Huh. Don't tell me
you do have another woman.

289
00:19:48,625 --> 00:19:49,458
What other woman?

290
00:19:49,541 --> 00:19:52,291
-This is a phone I use for work.
-Then who's this young Gold?

291
00:19:52,375 --> 00:19:54,166
I'll tell you who the woman is
when I get back.

292
00:19:54,250 --> 00:19:56,291
-Uh, hey!
-I mean, who Gold is.

293
00:19:56,375 --> 00:19:58,333
If you'd stop going on
about this other woman.

294
00:19:58,416 --> 00:20:01,208
If you can't explain it clearly,
how can I let it go?

295
00:20:01,291 --> 00:20:03,500
Felix Chiang, we're still talking here!

296
00:20:06,250 --> 00:20:09,416
STIR-FRIED SWAMP EEL, SWAMP EEL NOODLES

297
00:20:10,166 --> 00:20:11,666
-I wanted to ask.
-I wanted to ask.

298
00:20:12,583 --> 00:20:13,666
-You go first.
-You go first.

299
00:20:14,625 --> 00:20:15,583
Or I'll go.

300
00:20:15,666 --> 00:20:19,583
Have you ever heard of…
Parsinkin's disease?

301
00:20:20,375 --> 00:20:21,291
Parkinson's.

302
00:20:21,375 --> 00:20:23,208
-Yes, Parsonnkins.
-Parkin.

303
00:20:23,916 --> 00:20:25,208
All right, whatever.

304
00:20:26,750 --> 00:20:27,708
Anyway…

305
00:20:28,291 --> 00:20:30,166
The doctor says I have it.

306
00:20:35,583 --> 00:20:37,125
Hey, what is it with you?

307
00:20:37,208 --> 00:20:38,833
I say things. You don't reply.

308
00:20:38,916 --> 00:20:40,708
Not replying is fine, but at least eat.

309
00:20:40,791 --> 00:20:43,375
Do what they say,
and don't think about the future.

310
00:20:45,416 --> 00:20:47,000
I could slow you down.

311
00:20:47,958 --> 00:20:49,750
I noticed your hand ages ago.

312
00:20:50,250 --> 00:20:52,708
I know some good specialists.
I could introduce you to one.

313
00:20:55,958 --> 00:21:00,625
I was wondering if you might want to…
work with another fixer.

314
00:21:00,708 --> 00:21:02,083
I'm not doing that.

315
00:21:02,583 --> 00:21:04,166
No other fixer would do it.

316
00:21:06,208 --> 00:21:08,000
Hey. Your turn. What do you want to ask?

317
00:21:08,083 --> 00:21:09,500
-Mina.
-Mm.

318
00:21:09,583 --> 00:21:11,875
She got information from Lin Wan-li
to find someone.

319
00:21:11,958 --> 00:21:12,791
I want you on it.

320
00:21:12,875 --> 00:21:13,833
I'm fine with that.

321
00:21:13,916 --> 00:21:15,500
I haven't told you who the person is.

322
00:21:15,583 --> 00:21:19,041
Yeah, well, with Lin Wan-li,
we were lucky she helped out.

323
00:21:19,125 --> 00:21:23,250
And you know, she's clearly the one
my partner likes, so how could I not?

324
00:21:24,583 --> 00:21:27,791
I've noticed
that you've got a little crush.

325
00:21:28,833 --> 00:21:31,833
Hey, I know a person
who fixes these things.

326
00:21:31,916 --> 00:21:33,500
They're a fixer of love.

327
00:21:36,125 --> 00:21:38,625
It is I. I'll teach you a few tricks.

328
00:21:40,583 --> 00:21:45,291
Hey. A side hustle
is a violation of the Ching He way.

329
00:21:45,375 --> 00:21:46,958
Fixer Celestial is in.

330
00:21:48,750 --> 00:21:50,333
GERALD CHEN

331
00:21:51,125 --> 00:21:52,958
You're also looking for Gerald Chen.

332
00:21:53,541 --> 00:21:55,750
I was commissioned to do so.

333
00:21:55,833 --> 00:21:56,875
Who's the client?

334
00:21:57,458 --> 00:21:59,250
I can't reveal their identity.

335
00:21:59,750 --> 00:22:03,166
But finding Gerald
is important to Ching He.

336
00:22:03,250 --> 00:22:04,541
You need to know that.

337
00:22:04,625 --> 00:22:07,125
This is about Ching He's survival.

338
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:12,791
Gerald has something in his possession
that we have to retrieve.

339
00:22:13,625 --> 00:22:17,875
The survival of Ching He Temple
relies on a Yeh Yueh Tong fixer.

340
00:22:17,958 --> 00:22:19,125
Is this for real?

341
00:22:19,916 --> 00:22:21,416
The chairman didn't say a lot.

342
00:22:22,541 --> 00:22:25,666
Then you'll tell Mina
Gerald's wanted by Ching He.

343
00:22:25,750 --> 00:22:27,666
No, we can't talk.

344
00:22:28,875 --> 00:22:29,708
All right.

345
00:22:29,791 --> 00:22:32,583
Since it's commissioned,
it shouldn't be an issue.

346
00:22:34,250 --> 00:22:36,083
As we're starting out,

347
00:22:37,125 --> 00:22:38,500
I need a favor.

348
00:22:38,583 --> 00:22:39,500
Just a little one.

349
00:22:39,583 --> 00:22:42,291
-I'm not lending to you.
-It's not that.

350
00:22:42,791 --> 00:22:46,541
A rare appearance
by former Interior Minister Jerome Hsueh

351
00:22:46,625 --> 00:22:47,750
and his two sons.

352
00:22:47,833 --> 00:22:50,916
Besides his eldest son Tristan Hsueh,
who is currently…

353
00:22:51,000 --> 00:22:54,333
Uh, uh, he's your boss?

354
00:22:54,833 --> 00:22:56,958
There's no need to go on about it.

355
00:22:57,041 --> 00:22:58,958
My boss likes to be called Young Gold.

356
00:22:59,041 --> 00:23:00,583
-Ah.
-Isn't that right?

357
00:23:00,666 --> 00:23:02,500
Uh, Mr. Young Gold, hi.

358
00:23:02,583 --> 00:23:06,416
Ah. With your husband
looking after things, I feel very safe.

359
00:23:06,500 --> 00:23:09,708
That's right. Let's talk later.
I'm hungry. We should eat.

360
00:23:09,791 --> 00:23:10,875
Yes, let's eat.

361
00:23:11,958 --> 00:23:15,291
Come on. Your boss is such a big shot.
Why didn't you say so?

362
00:23:15,375 --> 00:23:18,291
-What?
-I've only prepared a simple meal.

363
00:23:18,375 --> 00:23:20,750
It's fine. Young Gold likes simple dishes.

364
00:23:20,833 --> 00:23:23,125
It's just simple lobster and simple fish.

365
00:23:23,208 --> 00:23:25,083
-Here.
-Dig in. Okay.

366
00:23:25,166 --> 00:23:26,875
Try this, huh?

367
00:23:28,083 --> 00:23:32,041
Mr. Young Gold,
thanks for taking on our Felix.

368
00:23:32,125 --> 00:23:33,291
As you're aware,

369
00:23:33,375 --> 00:23:37,166
he is returning to the workforce
after a midlife crisis.

370
00:23:37,250 --> 00:23:39,375
-Finding a job's not easy.
-What midlife crisis?

371
00:23:39,458 --> 00:23:42,333
It's called getting back onto the horse.

372
00:23:42,416 --> 00:23:44,416
Oh, is it now?

373
00:23:44,500 --> 00:23:46,208
And when did you
hand on the gambling joint?

374
00:23:46,291 --> 00:23:47,125
You never told me.

375
00:23:47,208 --> 00:23:48,708
Well, now you know, don't you?

376
00:23:48,791 --> 00:23:52,291
Now, having a man like your husband
returning to the workforce

377
00:23:52,375 --> 00:23:54,333
after a midlife crisis,

378
00:23:54,416 --> 00:23:55,750
working as my bodyguard…

379
00:23:55,833 --> 00:23:57,875
-I'm so lucky.
-Mm, I hope he's behaving.

380
00:23:58,458 --> 00:24:01,958
So why is Dad Young Gold's bodyguard now?

381
00:24:06,083 --> 00:24:09,125
Don't be fooled
by my boss's refined appearance.

382
00:24:09,208 --> 00:24:12,500
These super wealthy heirs
are getting into arguments all the time.

383
00:24:12,583 --> 00:24:14,958
They make enemies,
and that's when people like us,

384
00:24:15,041 --> 00:24:18,125
who are smart and capable,
help them navigate the social norms.

385
00:24:18,208 --> 00:24:20,791
-Oh. Yeah, it does. It does.
-That makes sense. Good.

386
00:24:20,875 --> 00:24:24,333
Oh, what fell out there? I'll go check.

387
00:24:25,333 --> 00:24:26,333
Hey.

388
00:24:26,416 --> 00:24:29,000
To the enemies of wealthy heirs, huh?

389
00:24:30,125 --> 00:24:32,166
How did the pot lid fall on its own?

390
00:24:32,250 --> 00:24:34,541
-I didn't touch it.
-I didn't put it there.

391
00:24:34,625 --> 00:24:37,208
She's nagging. You eat. Come on.

392
00:24:37,291 --> 00:24:39,208
I only carried out the dishes. It was Dad.

393
00:24:39,291 --> 00:24:41,833
-What's going on?
-Felix, the lid doesn't go here.

394
00:24:41,916 --> 00:24:44,166
-You're so careless.
-You told me to put it there.

395
00:24:44,250 --> 00:24:45,666
I did not.

396
00:24:45,750 --> 00:24:47,125
Keep it down, will you?

397
00:24:47,208 --> 00:24:49,083
-My boss will hear you.
-Oh, sorry.

398
00:24:49,166 --> 00:24:51,000
We gotta keep up appearances. All right?

399
00:24:51,083 --> 00:24:53,833
-I'm holding myself back.
-And you're doing really well.

400
00:24:53,916 --> 00:24:56,333
AUTHENTIC TIEN-BU-LA

401
00:24:59,166 --> 00:25:01,916
Okay, here's the tien-bu-la.

402
00:25:02,708 --> 00:25:04,958
-With no cilantro.
-Thank you.

403
00:25:05,041 --> 00:25:06,541
Wait, wait, wait.

404
00:25:06,625 --> 00:25:10,416
You said Zoe and William
are the Yuan Tao bosses.

405
00:25:10,500 --> 00:25:12,375
So if we get close to William, we can--

406
00:25:12,458 --> 00:25:14,708
Find out how Zoe's death
is connected to Gerald.

407
00:25:14,791 --> 00:25:16,208
That shouldn't be hard.

408
00:25:16,291 --> 00:25:19,416
Just kidnap William
and fucking beat him until he breaks down.

409
00:25:19,500 --> 00:25:21,458
That tactic might work on scum like Sheng,

410
00:25:22,291 --> 00:25:24,166
but with someone this high status,

411
00:25:24,666 --> 00:25:26,416
there'll be people protecting him.

412
00:25:26,500 --> 00:25:28,041
We don't wanna tip him off.

413
00:25:29,375 --> 00:25:32,458
So tell me, how will you make him talk?

414
00:25:32,541 --> 00:25:34,666
With people like him, you need leverage.

415
00:25:34,750 --> 00:25:36,916
Something that'll force him to comply.

416
00:25:37,791 --> 00:25:40,000
How'd you get leverage
on someone like that?

417
00:25:40,083 --> 00:25:42,625
We found out that he's swindling clients.

418
00:25:42,708 --> 00:25:47,000
Huh. My wife was scammed
by one of these bogus coins.

419
00:25:47,083 --> 00:25:48,875
How did you get this information?

420
00:25:49,416 --> 00:25:52,333
We've been doing the legwork.
No point waiting on you.

421
00:25:52,416 --> 00:25:54,541
Don't butt in. Just focus on your swing.

422
00:25:54,625 --> 00:25:57,541
Anyway, what kind of legwork
did you guys do?

423
00:26:03,125 --> 00:26:04,708
Fuck!

424
00:26:04,791 --> 00:26:07,375
In this fucking wind, how can I play?

425
00:26:09,333 --> 00:26:10,208
Hello.

426
00:26:11,333 --> 00:26:12,500
Louis Hsueh?

427
00:26:13,083 --> 00:26:16,208
Uh, sure. Yeah. Let's do it.

428
00:26:17,541 --> 00:26:18,833
What about the brother?

429
00:26:20,041 --> 00:26:22,250
Oh, okay. Bye.

430
00:26:24,583 --> 00:26:25,541
Here.

431
00:26:31,041 --> 00:26:32,458
Do you come here often?

432
00:26:32,958 --> 00:26:35,375
Oh, yeah. My office is right there.

433
00:26:35,458 --> 00:26:36,833
You mean Yuan Tao?

434
00:26:37,875 --> 00:26:39,041
I said that. Yeah.

435
00:26:39,125 --> 00:26:41,500
It's the first thing in your profile.

436
00:26:41,583 --> 00:26:42,833
Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah.

437
00:26:44,375 --> 00:26:45,541
I wanna ask.

438
00:26:45,625 --> 00:26:47,916
Why would you use a dating app?

439
00:26:48,000 --> 00:26:51,041
I mean, you don't need one.
You're perfect.

440
00:27:00,750 --> 00:27:02,125
Get me one more,

441
00:27:02,666 --> 00:27:03,541
I might tell you.

442
00:27:05,458 --> 00:27:07,208
Oh, okay.

443
00:27:09,000 --> 00:27:10,708
I'll go get the, uh…

444
00:27:11,333 --> 00:27:12,916
I'll just get the…

445
00:27:14,125 --> 00:27:17,208
Hey, excuse me. Can… can I have a, uh…

446
00:27:17,708 --> 00:27:19,833
Uh… oh.

447
00:27:19,916 --> 00:27:22,500
Uh, let me see. This one.

448
00:27:23,000 --> 00:27:24,000
Yeah.

449
00:27:36,875 --> 00:27:39,208
PLEASE SCAN YOUR FINGERPRINT

450
00:27:50,625 --> 00:27:54,041
Wow, the lowly second son sought me out.

451
00:27:54,125 --> 00:27:57,291
-I'm deeply flattered.
-Let's tee off, then we can talk.

452
00:27:57,375 --> 00:27:58,625
Okay.

453
00:27:58,708 --> 00:28:01,750
Coincidentally, I just ran into Tristan
at the chamber of commerce.

454
00:28:01,833 --> 00:28:03,916
-We talked about you.
-What did my brother say?

455
00:28:22,041 --> 00:28:25,375
Plug in the flash drive,
and the hacking program will install.

456
00:28:25,875 --> 00:28:27,416
Then just download files remotely.

457
00:28:28,541 --> 00:28:29,500
Thanks.

458
00:28:30,083 --> 00:28:32,291
-Hey, wait. Are you gonna shout me a meal?
-Next time.

459
00:28:33,416 --> 00:28:34,541
Yeah, right.

460
00:28:34,625 --> 00:28:35,708
I'm not a tool.

461
00:28:36,208 --> 00:28:39,583
Oh, really? So he felt like
you were treating him like a tool.

462
00:28:39,666 --> 00:28:40,541
That's not fair.

463
00:28:40,625 --> 00:28:41,541
-I know, right?
-Mm-hmm.

464
00:28:41,625 --> 00:28:43,666
And I didn't want him driving me
all the time.

465
00:28:43,750 --> 00:28:44,875
Mm.

466
00:28:44,958 --> 00:28:47,083
I usually split all the bills with him.

467
00:28:47,166 --> 00:28:49,208
Anyway, we broke up, so it's over now.

468
00:28:49,791 --> 00:28:51,083
I see, I see.

469
00:28:51,791 --> 00:28:53,541
Sorry. I drank too much.

470
00:28:53,625 --> 00:28:55,250
-I'm going to the restroom.
-Oh, right.

471
00:28:55,333 --> 00:28:56,625
Huh. Hmm.

472
00:28:56,708 --> 00:28:58,666
-Did you drop that?
-Oh, what?

473
00:28:58,750 --> 00:29:00,750
Oh, oh, yes.

474
00:29:00,833 --> 00:29:02,166
-Wait for me.
-Okay.

475
00:29:06,625 --> 00:29:09,375
You made that engineer wait there
until the place closed.

476
00:29:09,458 --> 00:29:10,291
So what?

477
00:29:12,208 --> 00:29:14,750
There's nothing in there
related to Gerald Chen.

478
00:29:14,833 --> 00:29:16,083
Yuan Tao also looks clean.

479
00:29:17,000 --> 00:29:18,625
But there's one thing that's interesting.

480
00:29:18,708 --> 00:29:21,458
Yuan Tao transferred a lot of cash
a year and a half ago

481
00:29:21,541 --> 00:29:23,125
to start a new concern.

482
00:29:23,625 --> 00:29:24,750
Tolita.

483
00:29:24,833 --> 00:29:27,708
The person in charge
is listed as this financial influencer.

484
00:29:27,791 --> 00:29:30,125
Hello, everyone. I'm Dolly. Today…

485
00:29:30,208 --> 00:29:32,333
We used to do this in San He, as well.

486
00:29:32,416 --> 00:29:35,041
We'd use stand-ins for a setup,
so the cops never found out.

487
00:29:35,125 --> 00:29:39,125
And then I discovered
Tolita had already been accused of fraud.

488
00:29:39,208 --> 00:29:41,000
But it all got hosed down,

489
00:29:41,083 --> 00:29:42,666
and the news was suppressed.

490
00:29:42,750 --> 00:29:45,333
This, uh, this Tolita organization.

491
00:29:45,416 --> 00:29:48,083
I don't think that's enough
to ruin William.

492
00:29:48,583 --> 00:29:50,875
That's why we're still here.
That's why you're here.

493
00:29:50,958 --> 00:29:53,083
We want you to actually achieve something.

494
00:29:53,166 --> 00:29:55,333
Can you be more polite
in the presence of a woman?

495
00:29:57,041 --> 00:29:58,458
This is where Do Bit comes in.

496
00:29:58,541 --> 00:30:01,875
The chance to buy into
a high-yield cryptocurrency

497
00:30:01,958 --> 00:30:03,875
will never be cheaper.

498
00:30:05,625 --> 00:30:07,625
Why do you want to invest in crypto?

499
00:30:07,708 --> 00:30:11,083
Given your family,
starting something up won't be a problem.

500
00:30:11,166 --> 00:30:14,291
My brother likes governing,
but money's my thing.

501
00:30:14,375 --> 00:30:15,625
You never get too much, do you?

502
00:30:17,875 --> 00:30:21,875
Then we have a shared interest,
but I prefer seeing everyone make money.

503
00:30:22,666 --> 00:30:26,875
Lately, I've been watching a crypto coin.
It's getting a lot of attention.

504
00:30:26,958 --> 00:30:29,083
It's called Do Bit.

505
00:30:29,666 --> 00:30:31,750
A YouTuber called Dolly recommended it.

506
00:30:31,833 --> 00:30:32,791
You heard of it?

507
00:30:33,541 --> 00:30:34,541
I've heard of it,

508
00:30:34,625 --> 00:30:36,916
but that kind of obscure product,

509
00:30:37,000 --> 00:30:38,375
that's not your thing.

510
00:30:38,458 --> 00:30:39,958
Wow, you're so against it.

511
00:30:40,541 --> 00:30:41,750
You got inside information?

512
00:30:44,083 --> 00:30:45,666
Only info on Yuan Tao,

513
00:30:46,250 --> 00:30:50,625
which allows 90% of my business partners
to profit through range trading.

514
00:30:51,958 --> 00:30:53,208
Oh, fuck it!

515
00:30:53,875 --> 00:30:56,000
This wind today. It's really weird.

516
00:30:57,791 --> 00:31:00,583
Regarding the political donation scandal,

517
00:31:00,666 --> 00:31:02,208
my stance is nonpartisan.

518
00:31:02,291 --> 00:31:04,166
Whoever it is, there will be justice.

519
00:31:04,250 --> 00:31:07,958
Then may I ask, sir, are there individuals
with ulterior motives behind the scenes?

520
00:31:09,916 --> 00:31:12,625
I've already implemented
disciplinary action.

521
00:31:12,708 --> 00:31:14,000
They'll be expelled.

522
00:31:15,041 --> 00:31:17,750
They've always supported us.
If he finds out--

523
00:31:17,833 --> 00:31:19,541
He won't find out.

524
00:31:21,125 --> 00:31:24,125
If you wanna rise to the top,
you have to be ruthless.

525
00:31:25,041 --> 00:31:26,791
If ever I'm for the cut,

526
00:31:26,875 --> 00:31:28,083
you must do it.

527
00:31:32,625 --> 00:31:33,750
Also,

528
00:31:33,833 --> 00:31:35,500
I had a call.

529
00:31:35,583 --> 00:31:38,708
William from Yuan Tao said
your brother reached out.

530
00:31:38,791 --> 00:31:40,708
He wants to invest in crypto.

531
00:31:40,791 --> 00:31:43,125
Huh. It's a small world.

532
00:31:43,208 --> 00:31:44,875
Dad, what do you want?

533
00:31:46,416 --> 00:31:49,541
By blood,
you're both part of the Hsueh line.

534
00:31:50,083 --> 00:31:52,750
So he also needs to assist here.

535
00:31:52,833 --> 00:31:54,500
He'll be able to help us.

536
00:31:55,000 --> 00:31:57,625
Dad, you can trust my judgment.

537
00:31:59,750 --> 00:32:03,583
By the way, at your follow-up,
what did the doctor say?

538
00:32:03,666 --> 00:32:04,833
Fundraising first.

539
00:32:05,916 --> 00:32:07,291
We'll talk about it later.

540
00:32:07,791 --> 00:32:10,083
Your business is the top priority.

541
00:32:16,583 --> 00:32:19,458
TRISTAN HSUEH

542
00:32:33,375 --> 00:32:36,083
-What are you doing?
-Uh, nothing.

543
00:32:36,666 --> 00:32:39,791
I'm seeing how long I can hold a gun
before my hand starts to shake.

544
00:32:39,875 --> 00:32:42,125
Whose hand doesn't shake
when it's kept raised?

545
00:32:43,458 --> 00:32:44,625
Yeah, you're right.

546
00:32:44,708 --> 00:32:47,333
Don't tremors happen
when the hand is at rest?

547
00:32:47,416 --> 00:32:49,958
The doctor says mine is a special case.

548
00:32:50,041 --> 00:32:53,416
The annoying thing is,
I have no idea when it's gonna get worse.

549
00:32:54,791 --> 00:32:58,000
Guns are a last resort.
It's not important that you lift a gun.

550
00:32:58,083 --> 00:33:01,416
What if, down the track,
I lose control of my legs?

551
00:33:04,125 --> 00:33:05,625
Hey. On the news,

552
00:33:05,708 --> 00:33:08,625
your brother's political crisis
is the lead story.

553
00:33:08,708 --> 00:33:10,791
I can't be worried about all that.

554
00:33:11,750 --> 00:33:13,250
Uh, us fixers.

555
00:33:13,333 --> 00:33:15,750
We're always helping others
solve their problems,

556
00:33:15,833 --> 00:33:19,500
but our own family matters,
they're the difficult ones.

557
00:33:20,000 --> 00:33:23,083
We have to talk
to this investment adviser, Hung Kuo-lung.

558
00:33:23,625 --> 00:33:25,125
What's his connection to Yuan Tao?

559
00:33:25,208 --> 00:33:27,666
There isn't any.
He just runs stock market scams.

560
00:33:27,750 --> 00:33:31,500
We need concrete evidence of fraud,
so you're the mark.

561
00:33:31,583 --> 00:33:32,958
Huh?

562
00:33:35,250 --> 00:33:36,666
Can you play mah-jongg?

563
00:33:37,291 --> 00:33:38,916
I'm a master at it.

564
00:33:39,666 --> 00:33:41,000
Mm?

565
00:33:42,916 --> 00:33:44,208
Huh? What?

566
00:33:44,291 --> 00:33:47,458
Hey. They're one-year contracts,
and no refund.

567
00:33:47,541 --> 00:33:50,166
I'll suggest another tomorrow.
Okay. Yeah, bye-bye.

568
00:33:52,250 --> 00:33:53,875
Hey there, buddy.

569
00:33:53,958 --> 00:33:56,125
If you have any sure bets, share them.

570
00:33:56,208 --> 00:33:57,958
Yeah. Are you new here?

571
00:33:58,041 --> 00:33:59,958
I haven't seen you before.

572
00:34:00,041 --> 00:34:02,000
I deal in seafood. It's a small concern.

573
00:34:02,083 --> 00:34:02,958
Oh.

574
00:34:03,041 --> 00:34:05,875
So do you hedge against inflation
by investing profits?

575
00:34:05,958 --> 00:34:07,833
Cash that I can see. I trust that.

576
00:34:07,916 --> 00:34:10,416
Don't be like that.
Hey, youngster, don't be like him.

577
00:34:10,500 --> 00:34:14,666
If in ten years your money's worth
is halved by inflation, that's your fault.

578
00:34:14,750 --> 00:34:17,208
Sorry, sir, can we begin?

579
00:34:17,291 --> 00:34:18,625
Oh, right, right, right. I start.

580
00:34:18,708 --> 00:34:20,375
Here, Red Dragon.

581
00:34:20,458 --> 00:34:23,416
A friend of mine did some investing,
and he got scammed.

582
00:34:23,500 --> 00:34:24,916
He lost millions.

583
00:34:25,000 --> 00:34:26,833
I wouldn't touch it. White Dragon.

584
00:34:26,916 --> 00:34:28,500
Ah. White Dragon, kong.

585
00:34:29,541 --> 00:34:30,458
Let me ask you.

586
00:34:30,958 --> 00:34:33,125
If eating gives you the runs,
do you just stop eating?

587
00:34:33,708 --> 00:34:36,958
No, you'll eat
what doesn't give you diarrhea.

588
00:34:37,041 --> 00:34:39,958
The person who called you
thinks you're scamming them, don't they?

589
00:34:41,666 --> 00:34:42,875
Yes.

590
00:34:42,958 --> 00:34:45,791
In this world,
there are people who will get conned,

591
00:34:46,375 --> 00:34:49,458
and a lot of people who con others.

592
00:34:51,291 --> 00:34:54,250
Just like the three of you here.

593
00:34:55,750 --> 00:34:58,625
You guys started sharing glances
quite a while back.

594
00:34:59,125 --> 00:35:02,833
If you wanna be hustlers,
practice a little before you come out.

595
00:35:02,916 --> 00:35:04,208
Four characters.

596
00:35:07,375 --> 00:35:09,125
I know how to play this game.

597
00:35:09,208 --> 00:35:11,833
Exposing you guys as hustlers here.

598
00:35:11,916 --> 00:35:13,458
Oh, that's not gonna end well.

599
00:35:13,541 --> 00:35:14,875
I say

600
00:35:15,375 --> 00:35:17,541
we quietly finish this round,

601
00:35:17,625 --> 00:35:20,125
you let me win, then we're all good.

602
00:35:23,083 --> 00:35:24,500
We aren't hustlers.

603
00:35:24,583 --> 00:35:26,041
We know all about you.

604
00:35:26,750 --> 00:35:29,375
We need you, a hustler, to help us out.

605
00:35:29,875 --> 00:35:31,625
-Help from me?
-Uh-huh.

606
00:35:32,500 --> 00:35:33,625
You think you can afford it?

607
00:35:41,583 --> 00:35:42,416
Mm-hmm.

608
00:35:51,458 --> 00:35:52,625
Hold on.

609
00:35:53,500 --> 00:35:54,375
Hold on.

610
00:35:55,708 --> 00:35:57,583
I must be getting old. I can't beat you.

611
00:35:57,666 --> 00:36:00,083
Couldn't beat me
when you were younger either.

612
00:36:00,583 --> 00:36:02,250
Aren't you super busy?

613
00:36:02,333 --> 00:36:03,750
You got time for this?

614
00:36:04,958 --> 00:36:09,125
Since Tomb-Sweeping Day,
Dad's health got worse.

615
00:36:10,208 --> 00:36:11,583
I know you don't want to see him.

616
00:36:11,666 --> 00:36:13,000
You know it's not that.

617
00:36:13,791 --> 00:36:15,291
He doesn't want to see me.

618
00:36:16,625 --> 00:36:18,708
He heard you've started investing.

619
00:36:18,791 --> 00:36:20,125
That made him happy.

620
00:36:22,208 --> 00:36:23,791
Did William say that?

621
00:36:24,791 --> 00:36:26,541
If you want my advice,

622
00:36:26,625 --> 00:36:29,125
if you wanna invest,
there are better options.

623
00:36:32,416 --> 00:36:33,791
What's wrong with William?

624
00:36:34,291 --> 00:36:35,458
How do you know him?

625
00:36:36,666 --> 00:36:39,833
There's nothing wrong.
I met him at a cocktail party.

626
00:36:40,333 --> 00:36:43,375
I don't feel that he's honest
or even clever.

627
00:36:43,958 --> 00:36:45,541
Don't rush into anything.

628
00:36:51,750 --> 00:36:52,583
Come on.

629
00:36:53,083 --> 00:36:55,500
-You still wanna play?
-One last game, okay?

630
00:36:55,583 --> 00:36:58,541
CANNON

631
00:36:58,625 --> 00:36:59,458
SOLDIER

632
00:36:59,958 --> 00:37:01,041
Check.

633
00:37:04,916 --> 00:37:07,083
Well, that was a risky move.

634
00:37:07,583 --> 00:37:09,958
You're left with a chariot and a cannon,

635
00:37:10,041 --> 00:37:12,000
yet you want to capture the general.

636
00:37:17,583 --> 00:37:18,458
HORSE

637
00:37:19,958 --> 00:37:20,833
CHARIOT

638
00:37:21,458 --> 00:37:22,541
HORSE

639
00:37:22,625 --> 00:37:24,958
Well, who said I was after the general?

640
00:37:27,250 --> 00:37:29,291
As all the pieces around it are taken,

641
00:37:30,000 --> 00:37:32,250
the general will eventually be caught.

642
00:37:32,875 --> 00:37:34,541
Did you come here

643
00:37:34,625 --> 00:37:38,208
to save or sacrifice the general?

644
00:37:44,125 --> 00:37:46,333
This old elephant.

645
00:37:46,416 --> 00:37:49,416
He's vulnerable,
and that's all I can handle.

646
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:51,916
There was a big case recently,

647
00:37:52,500 --> 00:37:54,583
and my fixers screwed it up.

648
00:37:55,166 --> 00:37:57,208
It was put down to my age,

649
00:37:57,708 --> 00:38:00,291
and I was accused of poor leadership.

650
00:38:00,375 --> 00:38:03,250
They said I'm old, and I should step down.

651
00:38:03,875 --> 00:38:07,000
If they really want you gone,
they'll find any excuse.

652
00:38:07,500 --> 00:38:10,416
And I still need
an old elephant around. Hmm?

653
00:38:13,291 --> 00:38:17,333
I'm afraid
that this old elephant will get taken out

654
00:38:17,416 --> 00:38:20,166
before it can offer you any protection.

655
00:38:40,416 --> 00:38:41,583
Madam Fan.

656
00:38:50,250 --> 00:38:51,833
Keep an eye on Mina.

657
00:38:52,541 --> 00:38:55,375
Find out what she's discovered lately.

658
00:38:55,458 --> 00:38:56,625
Got it.

659
00:39:09,583 --> 00:39:12,041
Target Zoe confirmed dead.
